**/dist/
# quota-glance embeds its application shell with go:embed, so web/dist is
# source, not build output. Without this the plugin fails to compile from a
# fresh clone, and the web app has nowhere to publish its build.
!plugins/quota-glance/web/dist/
!plugins/quota-glance/web/dist/**
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
.env

# Planning documents stay out of a public repository: they carry real addresses
# and subscription details. Keep them beside the checkout, not in it.
HANDOFF-*.md
